  "description": "*\"In the name of the Heavenly Demon... Hold on for just one second. Kunlun will be spared.\"*\n\nThe heretic of Kunlun, King Cheongpung, who believed in that promise, fell to the sword of the Heavenly Demon. A hundred years later, he woke up as a child and was shocked.\n\n*\"What? Kunlun is ruined?!\"*\n\nThose who betrayed the legendary hero and reduced his hometown to ashes. Will he be able to recover his lost past and rebuild Kunlun? His turbulent destiny begins!\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
